  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="border-right: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; border-left: Black 1pt solid; text-align: center; font-size: 10pt">06:00 A.M. ISRAEL TIME ON AUGUST 18, 2026 TO BE VALID</TD></TR>
